# AJX Tax — Commercial SaaS product bar

Treat AJX Tax as a **commercial SaaS product**, not an internal tool.

Every screen should be something you would be **proud to show another professional pilot**.

Follow `docs/standards/05-commercial-product-bar.md`.

## Before implementing any feature, ask

1. Does this make the user’s **annual tax preparation simpler**?
2. Does it **reduce effort**?
3. Does it **improve trust**?
4. Does it **improve audit readiness**?

If the answer to any is **no**, reconsider. Do **not** add complexity unless it clearly improves the product.

## First release

Must feel **polished, professional, and complete**, even when AI / OCR / Drive / roster parsing are intentionally deferred.

Prefer finishing the overnight claim loop (clarity, provenance, backup, export) over new surfaces.

## Product feel

Calm · clear · premium (Apple · Stripe · Linear · Flighty). No unfinished placeholders in the happy path. No spreadsheet-first UI. No unexplained numbers.
